    {
      "temp_id": "R023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "Applicability percentages must be applied to each discrete unit of activity (e.g., every hour) within the **Fulfillment Interval**. If the commitment is not fully utilized by eligible entities within that hour, the remaining capacity expires.",
